    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b521a624973b91e6965bcbd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的这些想法，\n虽然看起来像是漫画里才有的技巧……\n但其中的确蕴含着扎实的“思考”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81417cc06e6b39378c486cd87cd68d90ddc93795f4031627a39cb0694d77d399",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
