    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bf84ce257253fb3af76b62e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "躲雨的观众",
      "source_fingerprint": "1faf1a94e8e1a8045fc15e5abfae3bcee743b439a0df609b3a2785d9b2c13fc1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d70f0df1e970d01210ff2864",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呀ーーー、雨太大啦！\n牡蛎！　快到有屋顶的地方去！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49e226867bf37e958051526bc5d8c1e416801530690e2d07b8ff1c215bf2dd3a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25692a4a7577950a7cd2d035",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "由于台风逼近带来了暴雨，\n京都比赛场正遭受着汹涌雨水的侵袭。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c24f16b6936940501e0152095391b312c1d2d8b69413afd2284e10653595869c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137201.json",
      "json_path": [
