      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f8a5d3047b2c64b74d73320",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "什么呀、这场地……！\n我的冲势不该只有这种程度呀……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89a6678e70d1f48f4a69c58dbc6f3dd4fa5e33cf66074e639ea5d01a2caf6534",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:356d86436711b8ed1c001ca9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仅仅是站着便削减体力的恶劣环境。\n面对这种状况神业她――",
      "source_fingerprint": "14173c11f5ce03bf7d5b6bf7b73cc3130821e0ae06090549e4a2634306f51986",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137201.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0068183cfa9703c1020d8d9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神业",
      "source_fingerprint": "724792a2e3d296c7611773ef019203633319ea51a39af196ebd8de8dbc3c2a42",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1137/storytimeline_501137201.json",
      "json_path": [
