      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……正如神业所说。\n如果是她所开创的跑法，\n不论在哪种场地都能力大砖飞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bab32c995d9ba89f52c4a94645ca9802f0619fb7d788358a0f22a42c3c63aae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
