      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我可是在这个夏天，\n和那些三冠赛马娘还有小北\n一同训练过的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eeb9194e116a958f556fce4b19ab7616d59faa0f89fec00b802fa2b2a9e1b08",
